# Evasion (P1/P2) notes
# - P1 source files are TRACKED (committed, not generated):
#     src_beacon/asm/Syscall.x64.asm
#     src_beacon/include/Syscall.h
#     src_beacon/src/Core/Syscall.c
# - Debug PIC beacon outputs (beacon.x64.debug.*.bin/.exe, .pdata/.xdata) land
#   under src_beacon/build/ (ignored above). The loader-wrapped payload is
#   returned in-memory by the Adaptix BuildPayload plugin — nothing written to
#   the repo tree.
# - Config_sleepmask.h is a TRACKED seed (ships a default sleepmask BOF); the
#   BuildPayload plugin regenerates it at payload-gen, so it shows as modified
#   after generating a payload — `git checkout` it before committing unless you
#   intend to ship the regenerated BOF. Config_profile.h is per-payload and
#   fully generated (ignored above).

